.TH CSTR_DESTROY 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cstr_destroy \- destroy a cstr and set it to NULL
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cstring.h>

cstr_destroy(s);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Type-safe alias for cstring_destroy(). Destroys the string and sets the
pointer to NULL.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s   cstr variable to destroy
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Safe to call with a NULL pointer (no-op)
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstring_destroy (3)
